{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lead a team in a world where every enemy becomes an opportunity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command a team of up to three characters. Position your units carefully, manipulate enemies, and craft new skills in the middle of combat using materials dropped by your foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every battle can change the tools you have available. Defeat enemies, collect their materials, and transform them into new skills that reshape your strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/0d918580793d6595a8eac96910a85651.poster.avif?t=1774495750\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/0d918580793d6595a8eac96910a85651.webm?t=1774495750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/0d918580793d6595a8eac96910a85651.mp4?t=1774495750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet the Existentials</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beings born millions of years before humanity, the first rulers of the Earth. Today the world is divided between two sides:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some obey and seek to destroy the Earth by bringing about the apocalypse. Others fight to become rebels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Craft skills during combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies drop materials when defeated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use those materials <strong>mid-battle</strong> to craft new skills and immediately adapt your strategy. Each battle can give you new tools, allowing you to experiment with different combinations and tactical approaches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/22137a07679f3bb968a3651dbc5de110.poster.avif?t=1774495750\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/22137a07679f3bb968a3651dbc5de110.webm?t=1774495750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/22137a07679f3bb968a3651dbc5de110.mp4?t=1774495750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical combat on a hexagonal board</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your team across a <strong>hex-based battlefield</strong> where positioning is critical.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push enemies across the map, turn invisible, teleport across the board, upgrade your attacks and skills, or even take control of enemy units!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both you and your enemies operate with <strong>limited vision</strong>, forcing you to manage positioning and information carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/156b8fa3c560c211c3c9bae7e2399965.poster.avif?t=1774495750\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/156b8fa3c560c211c3c9bae7e2399965.webm?t=1774495750\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/extras/156b8fa3c560c211c3c9bae7e2399965.mp4?t=1774495750\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 playable existentials</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one features unique mechanics and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ effects that can appear in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genetic and apocalyptic damage types with specialized defenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited vision system for both you and your enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical mechanics including pushing, invisibility, teleportation and mind control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Existential has one or two \u201cFormalities.\u201d Like rock\u2011paper\u2011scissors, each formality has an advantage over another, granting you exclusive bonuses according to your choice: Colossus, Predator, Invader, Occultist, Analyst, Acrobat, or Changeling. Choose your favorite!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handmade love and chaos in every pixel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 gameplay challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 save slots</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you feel the clocks stop?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make time move again and add <strong>Bereshipsis</strong> to your wishlist!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798630?t=1774495750","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3798630?t=1774495750","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/49365553db0b3c11fd37294e3cf057cab3f7d85a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774495750","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/49365553db0b3c11fd37294e3cf057cab3f7d85a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774495750","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Lea