li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each one features unique mechanics and playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ effects that can appear in combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genetic and apocalyptic damage types with specialized defenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Limited vision system for both you and your enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical mechanics including pushing, invisibility, teleportation and mind control</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each Existential has one or two \u201cFormalities.\u201d Like rock\u2011paper\u2011scissors, each formality has an advantage over another, granting you exclusive bonuses according to your choice: Colossus, Predator, Invader, Occultist, Analyst, Acrobat, or Changeling. Choose your favorite!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Handmade love and chaos in every pixel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >11 gameplay challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 save slots</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Do you feel the clocks stop?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Make time move again and add <strong>Bereshipsis</strong> to your wishlist!</p>","developers":["Vic"],"genres":[{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3798630/eacfd1cfeecd1efd8dc5b04650943d607a398aca/header.jpg?t=1774495750","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3798630/457607529/aaa391e9ed507627329274d424c913f14a3c3285/1774495282/dash_av1.mpd?t=1774495749","dash_h2